<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>H4 Billing ERP - Quotation & Invoice Manager</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--primary:#6A3FA0;--secondary:#8A6510;--accent:#00BCD4;--success:#2e7d32;--danger:#d32f2f;--warning:#ef6c00;--bg:#f4f5f7;--surface:#fff;--text:#202124;--muted:#6b7280;--border:#e5e7eb;--shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08);--shadow-lg:0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.16)}
html,body{min-height:100%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.45}
body{padding-bottom:72px}.app-header{height:64px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--primary));color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 16px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.header-left,.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.app-title{font-weight:700}.menu-toggle{border:0;background:#ffffff24;color:#fff;border-radius:9px;font-size:22px;padding:8px;cursor:pointer}
.sidebar{position:fixed;z-index:1200;top:0;left:0;width:270px;height:100vh;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);transform:translateX(-105%);transition:.25s;overflow:auto}.sidebar.active{transform:translateX(0)}
.sidebar-header{padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--secondary));color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:18px}.sidebar-title{padding:16px 16px 7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800}.sidebar-item{padding:12px 16px;border-left:4px solid transparent;cursor:pointer}.sidebar-item:hover,.sidebar-item.active{background:#f6f2fb;border-left-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);font-weight:700}
.main-content{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:22px}.module{display:none}.module.active{display:block}.page-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--primary));color:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.page-header h1{font-size:28px}.page-header p{opacity:.9;margin-top:5px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.card-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:16px}.card-header h2{font-size:18px;color:var(--primary)}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}.form-row-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.form-group{margin-bottom:14px}.form-group label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin-bottom:6px}.form-group input,.form-group select,.form-group textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9px;padding:10px 11px;font:inherit;background:#fff}.form-group input:focus,.form-group select:focus,.form-group textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #6a3fa01a}.hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.check input{width:auto}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 14px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px}.btn-primary{color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--secondary))}.btn-secondary{color:#fff;background:var(--accent)}.btn-success{color:#fff;background:var(--success)}.btn-danger{color:#fff;background:var(--danger)}.btn-outline{background:#fff;color:var(--primary);border:1px solid var(--primary)}.btn-sm{padding:6px 9px;font-size:12px}.btn-block{width:100%}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.stat-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;text-align:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.stat-value{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary)}.stat-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto}.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:760px}.table th{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:10px}.table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top}.table-actions{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.modal-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#0008;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;z-index:3000}.modal-overlay.active{display:flex}.modal-content{width:min(760px,100%);max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}.modal-header{padding:15px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--secondary));color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.modal-close{border:0;background:none;color:#fff;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}.modal-body{padding:18px}.modal-footer{padding:12px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px}.notifications{position:fixed;right:15px;top:78px;z-index:5000;width:min(380px,calc(100% - 30px))}.notification{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);padding:12px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}.notification.success{border-color:var(--success)}.notification.danger{border-color:var(--danger)}
.bottom-nav{position:fixed;z-index:1100;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:none;box-shadow:0 -4px 12px #00000012}.nav-item{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:8px 3px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.nav-item.active{color:var(--primary);font-weight:800}.nav-icon{display:block;font-size:20px}
.rate-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px}.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.pill-auto{background:#e8f5e9;color:#1b5e20}.pill-override{background:#fff3e0;color:#e65100}.pill-none{background:#ffebee;color:#b71c1c}
.epoxy-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#edf0f5;z-index:2500;display:none;flex-direction:column}.epoxy-overlay.active{display:flex}.epoxy-top{height:64px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 14px;flex:none}.epoxy-top h2{font-size:17px;color:var(--primary)}.epoxy-body{min-height:0;flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(360px,520px) 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px}.builder-panel,.preview-panel{min-height:0;overflow:auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px}.builder-panel{padding:14px}.preview-panel{background:#8b9099;padding:22px}.steps{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:12px;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:2}.step{min-width:75px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}.step.active{background:#f2ebfa;border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);font-weight:800}.step.done{border-color:#a5d6a7}.epoxy-step{display:none}.epoxy-step.active{display:block}.step-title{font-size:20px;color:var(--primary);margin:8px 0 14px}.epoxy-footer{height:64px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;flex:none}.step-counter{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.preview-a4{width:210mm;min-height:297mm;background:#fff;margin:0 auto;box-shadow:0 2px 18px #0005;color:#222;overflow:hidden}.proposal-page{min-height:297mm;padding:14mm;page-break-after:always;position:relative}.proposal-cover{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0,#faf7ff 60%,#f4ecff 100%)}.proposal-brand{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:flex-start}.proposal-logo{width:90px;height:70px;object-fit:contain}.proposal-kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#7b61a5;font-weight:800}.proposal-title{font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;color:#4e267a;margin-top:8px}.proposal-subtitle{font-size:12px;color:#777;margin-top:8px}.proposal-rule{height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--primary),var(--secondary));margin:18px 0}.p-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.p-box{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:7px;padding:10px}.p-box h4{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#76539b;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.8px}.p-label{font-size:9px;color:#777}.p-value{font-size:11px;font-weight:650}.p-section-title{font-size:15px;color:#4e267a;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px;margin:0 0 10px}.p-list{margin:0;padding-left:16px;font-size:10px}.p-list li{margin:4px 0}.p-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px}.p-table th{background:#4e267a;color:#fff;padding:6px;text-align:left}.p-table td{padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.p-total{margin-left:auto;width:55%;font-size:10px}.p-total div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:3px 0}.p-grand{font-size:14px!important;font-weight:800;border-top:2px solid #4e267a;margin-top:4px;padding-top:6px!important}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;font-size:10px}.feature{padding:6px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px}.signature-box{height:80px;border-bottom:1px solid #777;margin-top:12px}.qr{width:110px;height:110px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid #ddd}.preview-empty{padding:60px 20px;color:#fff;text-align:center}
.price-item{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fafafa}.price-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}.rate-lock{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.scope-row,.feature-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}.mini-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.mini-grid .form-group{margin-bottom:8px}.danger-text{color:var(--danger);font-size:12px}.success-text{color:var(--success);font-size:12px}.empty{padding:25px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}.inline-add{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.inline-add input{flex:1}.summary-box{background:#f7f3fb;border:1px solid #dfd1ef;border-radius:10px;padding:12px}.summary-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:3px 0}.summary-grand{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);border-top:1px solid #cbb8df;margin-top:5px;padding-top:7px}
.modifier-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr auto;gap:6px;align-items:center;padding:6px 8px;background:#f8f6fb;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:4px}.modifier-row .mod-name{font-weight:600;font-size:12px}.modifier-row .mod-value{font-size:12px;color:var(--primary)}.modifier-row .mod-remove{color:var(--danger);cursor:pointer;padding:0 4px}
@media(max-width:900px){.epoxy-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}.preview-panel{display:none}.epoxy-overlay.mobile-preview .builder-panel{display:none}.epoxy-overlay.mobile-preview .preview-panel{display:block}.preview-a4{transform-origin:top center;transform:scale(.72);margin-bottom:-80mm}.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:680px){.main-content{padding:12px}.form-row,.form-row-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:70vh;top:auto;bottom:0;transform:translateY(105%)}.sidebar.active{transform:translateY(0)}.bottom-nav{display:flex}.app-header{position:sticky}.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.epoxy-body{padding:7px}.builder-panel{border-radius:10px;padding:11px}.epoxy-top{height:58px}.epoxy-footer{height:58px}.mini-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.p-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.p-total{width:100%}}
@media print{body>*:not(#printArea){display:none!important}#printArea{display:block!important}.preview-a4{box-shadow:none;margin:0;width:210mm}.proposal-page{page-break-after:always}}
#printArea{display:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="app-header">
  <div class="header-left"><button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle">☰</button><div class="app-title">H4 Billing ERP</div></div>
</header>

<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="sidebar-header">🏢 H4 Billing ERP</div>
  <div class="sidebar-title">Dashboard</div><div class="sidebar-item active" data-module="dashboard">📊 Dashboard</div>
  <div class="sidebar-title">Setup</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="company">🏭 Company Profile</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="themes">🎨 Themes</div>
  <div class="sidebar-title">Master Data</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="customers">👥 Customers</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="products">📦 Products</div>
  <div class="sidebar-title">Documents</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="quotations">📄 Quotations</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="invoices">🧾 Invoices</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="payments">💰 Payments</div>
  <div class="sidebar-title">Tools</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="templates">📋 Templates</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="backup">💾 Backup</div><div class="sidebar-item" data-module="settings">⚙️ Settings</div>
</aside>

<main class="main-content">
<section class="module active" data-module="dashboard">
  <div class="page-header"><h1>📊 Dashboard</h1><p>H4 quotation, invoice and project billing workspace</p></div>
  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" id="todayQuotations">0</div><div class="stat-label">Quotations</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" id="todayInvoices">0</div><div class="stat-label">Invoices</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" id="totalCustomers">0</div><div class="stat-label">Customers</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value" id="totalProducts">0</div><div class="stat-label">Products</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h2>Quick Actions</h2></div><div class="toolbar">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="H4App.newQuotation()">➕ New Quotation</button>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="H4App.newInvoice()">➕ New Invoice</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="H4App.navigate('customers');H4App.openModal('customerModal')">👥 Add Customer</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="H4App.navigate('products');H4App.openModal('productModal')">📦 Add Product</button>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="module" data-module="company">
<div class="page-header"><h1>🏭 Company Profile</h1><p>Company information used automatically in proposals and invoices</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h2>Business Information</h2></div>
<form id="companyForm">
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Legal Company Name *</label><input id="legalName" required></div><div class="form-group"><label>Brand Name</label><input id="brandName"></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label>Business Type</label><select id="businessType"><option>Manufacturing</option><option>Trading</option><option>Service</option><option>Distributor</option></select></div>
<div class="form-group"><label>Address *</label><textarea id="address" rows="2" required></textarea></div>
<div class="form-row-3"><div class="form-group"><label>City</label><input id="city"></div><div class="form-group"><label>District</label><input id="district"></div><div class="form-group"><label>State</label><input id="state"></div></div>
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>PIN</label><input id="pin"></div><div class="form-group"><label>Website</label><input id="website" type="url"></div></div>
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Phone *</label><input id="phone" required></div><div class="form-group"><label>WhatsApp</label><input id="whatsapp"></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label>Email</label><input id="email" type="email"></div>
<div class="check form-group"><input type="checkbox" id="gstEnabled"><label for="gstEnabled">GST Enabled</label></div>
<div id="gstFields"><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>GSTIN</label><input id="gstin" maxlength="15"></div><div class="form-group"><label>GST State Code</label><input id="gstStateCode" maxlength="2"></div></div></div>
<div class="check form-group"><input type="checkbox" id="panEnabled"><label for="panEnabled">PAN Enabled</label></div>
<div id="panFields"><div class="form-group"><label>PAN</label><input id="pan" maxlength="10"></div></div>
<div class="check form-group"><input type="checkbox" id="bankEnabled"><label for="bankEnabled">Bank Details</label></div>
<div id="bankFields"><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Bank Name</label><input id="bankName"></div><div class="form-group"><label>Account Name</label><input id="accountName"></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Account Number</label><input id="accountNumber"></div><div class="form-group"><label>IFSC</label><input id="ifsc"></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Branch</label><input id="branch"></div><div class="form-group"><label>UPI ID</label><input id="upiId"></div></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label>Default Terms</label><textarea id="terms" rows="3"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label>Footer Text</label><input id="footerText"></div>
<div class="toolbar" style="justify-content:flex-end"><button class="btn btn-primary">💾 Save Company Profile</button></div>
</form></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h2>Logo & Signature</h2></div>
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Upload Logo</label><input type="file" id="logoUpload" accept="image/*"><div id="logoPreview" class="image-preview" style="margin-top:8px;display:none"><img id="logoImage"></div></div><div class="form-group"><label>Upload Signature</label><input type="file" id="signatureUpload" accept="image/*"><div id="signaturePreview" class="image-preview" style="margin-top:8px;display:none"><img id="signatureImage"></div></div></div>
<div class="form-group"><label>Authorized Signatory Name</label><input id="signatoryName"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="module" data-module="customers"><div class="page-header"><h1>👥 Customers</h1><p>Customer master</p></div><div class="card"><div class="toolbar" style="margin-bottom:12px"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="H4App.openModal('customerModal')">➕ Add Customer</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Company</th><th>Phone</th><th>WhatsApp</th><th>Address</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="customersBody"></tbody></table></div></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="products"><div class="page-header"><h1>📦 Products / Materials</h1><p>Product master</p></div><div class="card"><div class="toolbar" style="margin-bottom:12px"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="H4App.openModal('productModal')">➕ Add Product</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Category</th><th>Unit</th><th>Rate</th><th>GST</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="productsBody"></tbody></table></div></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="quotations"><div class="page-header"><h1>📄 Quotations</h1><p>General quotations and Premium Epoxy Flooring Proposals</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="toolbar" style="margin-bottom:14px"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="H4App.newQuotation()">➕ New Quotation</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>Date</th><th>Type</th><th>Customer</th><th>Project</th><th>Total</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="quotationsBody"></tbody></table></div></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="invoices"><div class="page-header"><h1>🧾 Invoices</h1><p>Invoice records and quotation conversion</p></div><div class="card"><div class="toolbar" style="margin-bottom:14px"><button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="H4App.newInvoice()">➕ New Invoice</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>Date</th><th>Customer</th><th>Reference</th><th>Total</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="invoicesBody"></tbody></table></div></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="payments"><div class="page-header"><h1>💰 Payments</h1><p>Payment tracking</p></div><div class="card"><p class="empty">Payment tracking can be extended without changing quotation history.</p></div></section>
<section class="module" data-module="templates"><div class="page-header"><h1>📋 Templates</h1><p>Template-aware quotation architecture</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Available quotation templates</h3><ul style="padding:15px 25px"><li>General Quotation</li><li><strong>Premium Epoxy Flooring Proposal</strong></li><li>3D Epoxy Proposal (ready for future template)</li><li>Waterproofing Proposal (ready for future template)</li><li>Tile Adhesive Quotation (ready for future template)</li><li>Custom Proposal (ready for future template)</li></ul></div></section>
<section class="module" data-module="themes"><div class="page-header"><h1>🎨 Themes</h1><p>Document appearance</p></div><div class="card"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="H4App.openModal('themeModal')">➕ Create Theme</button><div id="themesContainer" style="margin-top:15px"></div></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="backup"><div class="page-header"><h1>💾 Backup & Restore</h1><p>All data including Rate Master and Unit Master is included</p></div>
<div class="card"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" onclick="H4App.downloadBackup()">📥 Download Complete Backup</button></div>
<div class="card"><div class="form-group"><label>Backup File</label><input type="file" id="backupFile" accept=".json"></div><button class="btn btn-danger btn-block" onclick="H4App.restoreBackup()">⚠️ Restore Backup</button></div></section>

<section class="module" data-module="settings"><div class="page-header"><h1>⚙️ Settings</h1><p>GST, numbering, validity, Rate Master and Unit Master</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-header"><h2>General Settings</h2></div><form id="settingsForm">
<div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label>Currency</label><select id="currency"><option value="INR">₹ INR</option><option value="USD">$ USD</option><option value="EUR">€ EUR</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Date Format</label><select id="dateFormat"><option>DD/MM/YYYY</option><option>MM/DD/YYYY</option><option>YYYY-MM-DD</option></select></div></div>
